  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH Go SIWC",
      "text": "[English](README.en.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "预览版已撤回，暂停安装",
      "text": "2026-11-06：`v0.2.1` 预览版已撤回。实际聊天发现，自定义请求来源检查会误拦截正常使用；此前的登录、模型发现和令牌刷新验证没有覆盖这一问题。\n\n当前没有对外提供可安装的发布版本。修正版正在本地试用，完成实际使用验证后再考虑发布。仓库保留源码和历史记录，现有实现及其他文档仅供历史参考。"
    },
    {
      "section": "已安装用户",
      "text": "可先切换到 DSH 的其他 Provider。需要移除本插件时，在插件面板退出登录，再在对应主机终端执行：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove local-openai-siwc\n```\n\n随后重启引擎。移除插件通常保留本地数据，登录数据请通过面板中的退出登录及取消记住登录操作清理。\n\n问题反馈：[Issues](https://github.com/martin2026US-lab/dsh-go-siwc/issues)。请妥善保管令牌与账户资料。"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Go SIWC",
      "text": "[中文](README.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Preview withdrawn — installation paused",
      "text": "2026-11-06: Preview `v0.2.1` has been withdrawn. Actual chat use exposed custom request-origin checks that reject valid requests. Earlier sign-in, model discovery and token-refresh checks did not cover this failure.\n\nThere is currently no public installable release. A corrected build is undergoing local trials; publication will be reconsidered after practical validation. Source and history remain available. The current implementation and other documents are historical references."
    },
    {
      "section": "Existing installations",
      "text": "Switch to another DSH Provider while this preview is withdrawn. To remove the plugin, sign out in its panel, then run on the corresponding engine host:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove local-openai-siwc\n```\n\nRestart the engine afterward. Removal generally retains local data; use the panel's sign-out and stop-remembering controls to clear saved credentials.\n\nReport issues through [Issues](https://github.com/martin2026US-lab/dsh-go-siwc/issues). Keep tokens and account data private."
    }
  ],
